Z||000000||Frank Sombers||09-26-2001||10:14 PM||||The 2nd Annual Pontiac Show will be held on Sunday, October 7, 2001, 10:00 AM to 3:00 PM, at Star Pontiac/GMC. This show is sponsored by the GTO Association of Pa.<P>Star's location is Route 33 & Hecktown Road, Easton. Pa. (For you Lancaster/Reading/York Fiero folks take Route 22 east and then get on Route 33 north. Hecktown Road exit is about 1 mile north of Route 22 and Star is right off the exit).<P>For additional directions and info call either: Greg at (908) 537-2116, or Curt at (610) 253-1064.<P>I will be visiting our Boilermaker that weekend and won't be there, but hopefully the Fiero will be well represented.<P>Thanks,<BR>Frank  <P>||||reg||1
